# Binary assets — never apply line-ending conversion (this repo has core.autocrlf=true).
# The sample intake PDFs are mostly-ASCII, so Git would otherwise treat them as text
# and CRLF-convert them on checkout, breaking the PDF xref byte offsets.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.db    binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.xls   binary
*.uipx  binary
*.nupkg binary
